# 统一换行符：检出时按平台，入库时一律 LF。
# 例外：Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 可能吃掉行尾导致诡异错误。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.command text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.opus binary
*.ape binary

# 这些文件在 diff 里出现说明有问题（应该被 .gitignore 挡住）
config.toml -diff
secrets.toml -diff
mappings.json -diff
*.sqlite3 -diff
